  \"evidenceUri\": \"https://storage.pxn.com/proof/email_screenshot.png\",
  \"description\": \"Contacted John Smith via email, had 30-minute call\",
  \"submittedAt\": \"2025-12-01T15:30:00Z\",
  \"submitterId\": \"op_123\"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  \"proofId\": \"proof_789ghi\",
  \"mandateId\": \"cam_456def\",
  \"status\": \"verified\",
  \"verifiedAt\": \"2025-12-01T15:30:05Z\",
