## resonance ENGINE API

### Generate Coherent Action Mandate

**Endpoint:** `POST /resonance/mandate/generate`

**Description:** Generate a Coherent Action Mandate (CAM) based on current coherence

**Request:**
```json
{
  \"operatorId\": \"op_123\",
  \"summaryHint\": \"optional custom summary\",
  \"requireProof\": true,
  \"mzsStrict\": true,
  \"context\": {
    \"missionPhase\": \"expansion\",
    \"urgency\": \"normal\"
  }
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  \"mandate\": {
    \"id\": \"cam_456def\",
    \"summary\": \"Contact one stakeholder and commit to listening\",
    \"rationale\": \"Generated from fusedState (fusedScore=0.85, ℒ=0.9456)\",
    \"generatedAt\": \"2025-12-01T09:00:00Z\",
    \"requiredProofOfAction\": true,
    \"mzsLocked\": false,
    \"suggestedEvidence\": [\"photo\", \"log\", \"timestamp\"],
    \"dueBy\": \"2025-12-01T23:59:59Z\",
    \"priority\": \"high\",
    \"metadata\": {
      \"loveCoefficient\": 0.9456,
      \"mzsReason\": \"MZS Prophetic Lock failed (ℒ=0.9456 < 1.0)\",
      \"coherenceSnapshot\": { \"F\": 0.88, \"L\": 0.92, \"H\": 0.86 }
    }
  },
  \"audit\": {
    \"id\": \"audit_321xyz\",
    \"mandateId\": \"cam_456def\",
    \"coherenceStateAtGeneration\": { ... },
    \"loveCoefficientAtGeneration\": 0.9456,
    \"outcome\": \"pending\",
    \"createdAt\": \"2025-12-01T09:00:00Z\"
  }
}
```

### Get Active Mandates

**Endpoint:** `GET /resonance/mandate/active`

**Query Parameters:**
- `operatorId` (required)
- `status` (optional: pending, verified, rejected, timeout)

**Response:**
```json
{
  \"mandates\": [
    {
      \"id\": \"cam_456def\",
      \"summary\": \"Contact one stakeholder and commit to listening\",
      \"status\": \"pending\",
      \"generatedAt\": \"2025-12-01T09:00:00Z\",
      \"dueBy\": \"2025-12-01T23:59:59Z\",
      \"loveCoefficient\": 0.9456,
      \"mzsLocked\": false,
      \"proofSubmitted\": false
    }
  ],
  \"count\": 1
}
```

### Submit Proof of Action

**Endpoint:** `POST /resonance/mandate/{mandateId}/proof`

**Description:** Submit proof that a mandate was completed

**Request:**
```json
{
  \"evidenceType\": \"email_log\",
  \"evidenceUri\": \"https://storage.pxn.com/proof/email_screenshot.png\",
  \"description\": \"Contacted John Smith via email, had 30-minute call\",
  \"submittedAt\": \"2025-12-01T15:30:00Z\",
  \"submitterId\": \"op_123\"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  \"proofId\": \"proof_789ghi\",
  \"mandateId\": \"cam_456def\",
  \"status\": \"verified\",
  \"verifiedAt\": \"2025-12-01T15:30:05Z\",
  \"audit\": {
    \"id\": \"audit_321xyz\",
    \"outcome\": \"verified\",
    \"notes\": \"Proof accepted. Mandate completed successfully.\",
    \"updatedAt\": \"2025-12-01T15:30:05Z\"
  }
}
```

### Get Mandate Audit Trail

**Endpoint:** `GET /resonance/mandate/{mandateId}/audit`

**Response:**
```json
{
  \"audit\": {
    \"id\": \"audit_321xyz\",
    \"mandate\": { ... },
    \"coherenceStateAtGeneration\": { ... },
    \"loveCoefficientAtGeneration\": 0.9456,
    \"outcome\": \"verified\",
    \"proof\": {
      \"evidenceType\": \"email_log\",
      \"evidenceUri\": \"https://...\",
      \"submittedAt\": \"2025-12-01T15:30:00Z\"
    },
    \"timeline\": [
      {
        \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-01T09:00:00Z\",
        \"event\": \"mandate_generated\",
        \"actor\": \"system\"
      },
      {
        \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-01T15:30:00Z\",
        \"event\": \"proof_submitted\",
        \"actor\": \"op_123\"
      },
      {
        \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-01T15:30:05Z\",
        \"event\": \"proof_verified\",
        \"actor\": \"FAV_system\"
      }
    ],
    \"createdAt\": \"2025-12-01T09:00:00Z\",
    \"updatedAt\": \"2025-12-01T15:30:05Z\"
  }
}
```

