## AUDIT TRAIL API

### Get System Audit Log

**Endpoint:** `GET /audit/system`

**Query Parameters:**
- `startDate` (ISO 8601)
- `endDate` (ISO 8601)
- `eventType` (optional: mandate_generated, proof_submitted, coherence_updated, lock_status_changed, etc.)
- `severity` (optional: info, warning, critical)
- `limit` (default: 100, max: 1000)

**Response:**
```json
{
  \"logs\": [
    {
      \"id\": \"log_999\",
      \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-01T15:30:05Z\",
      \"eventType\": \"proof_verified\",
      \"severity\": \"info\",
      \"actor\": \"FAV_system\",
      \"target\": \"cam_456def\",
      \"details\": {
        \"mandateId\": \"cam_456def\",
        \"proofId\": \"proof_789ghi\",
        \"verificationMethod\": \"manual_review\"
      },
      \"metadata\": {
        \"ip\": \"192.168.1.100\",
        \"userAgent\": \"PXN-Client/1.0\"
      }
    }
  ],
  \"pagination\": {
    \"total\": 15623,
    \"limit\": 100,
    \"offset\": 0,
    \"hasMore\": true
  }
}
```

### Get Operator Audit Trail

**Endpoint:** `GET /audit/operator/{operatorId}`

**Query Parameters:**
- `startDate` (ISO 8601)
- `endDate` (ISO 8601)
- `actionType` (optional: coherence_update, mandate_action, grace_event, etc.)

**Response:**
```json
{
  \"operatorId\": \"op_123\",
  \"auditTrail\": [
    {
      \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-01T08:30:00Z\",
      \"action\": \"coherence_state_submitted\",
      \"details\": {
        \"F\": 0.88,
        \"L\": 0.92,
        \"H\": 0.86,
        \"loveCoefficient\": 0.9456
      }
    },
    {
      \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-01T09:00:00Z\",
      \"action\": \"mandate_generated\",
      \"details\": {
        \"mandateId\": \"cam_456def\",
        \"summary\": \"Contact one stakeholder...\"
      }
    },
    {
      \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-01T15:30:00Z\",
      \"action\": \"proof_submitted\",
      \"details\": {
        \"mandateId\": \"cam_456def\",
        \"proofId\": \"proof_789ghi\"
      }
    }
  ],
  \"summary\": {
    \"totalActions\": 312,
    \"coherenceUpdates\": 45,
    \"mandatesGenerated\": 42,
    \"proofsSubmitted\": 38,
    \"graceEventsLogged\": 45
  }
}
```

### Get TLM/SBF Drift Report

**Endpoint:** `GET /audit/tlm/drift`

**Query Parameters:**
- `period` (7d, 30d, 90d)

**Response:**
```json
{
  \"period\": \"30d\",
  \"driftDetections\": [
    {
      \"timestamp\": \"2025-11-15T14:22:00Z\",
      \"type\": \"ambition_drift\",
