## ERROR HANDLING

### Error Response Format

All errors follow this structure:

```json
{
  \"error\": {
    \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\",
    \"message\": \"Love coefficient value must be between 0 and 1\",
    \"details\": {
      \"field\": \"L\",
      \"providedValue\": 1.5,
      \"allowedRange\": [0, 1]
    },
    \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-01T16:45:00Z\",
    \"requestId\": \"req_abc123\"
  }
}
```

