## COHERENCE STATE API

### Submit Coherence State

**Endpoint:** `POST /coherence/state`

**Description:** Submit daily coherence input (Ψ)

**Request:**
```json
{
  \"operatorId\": \"op_123\",
  \"F\": 0.88,
  \"L\": 0.92,
  \"H\": 0.86,
  \"fusedScore\": 0.85,
  \"notes\": \"Feeling aligned and purposeful today\",
  \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-01T08:30:00Z\"
}
```

**Validation:**
- All axis values must be [0, 1]
- Timestamp must be ISO 8601 format
- Cannot submit more than once per 8-hour period

**Response:**
```json
{
  \"id\": \"cs_789abc\",
  \"operatorId\": \"op_123\",
  \"coherenceState\": {
    \"F\": 0.88,
    \"L\": 0.92,
    \"H\": 0.86,
    \"fusedScore\": 0.85,
    \"timestamp\": \"2025-12-01T08:30:00Z\"
  },
  \"loveCoefficient\": 0.9456,
  \"mzsLocked\": false,
  \"vefGateStatus\": \"open\",
  \"createdAt\": \"2025-12-01T08:30:05Z\"
}
```

### Get Current Coherence State

