## AUTHENTICATION

### Obtain Access Token

**Endpoint:** `POST /auth/login`

**Request:**
```json
{
  \"operatorId\": \"string\",
  \"password\": \"string\",
  \"mfaCode\": \"string\"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  \"accessToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",
  \"refreshToken\": \"string\",
  \"expiresIn\": 3600,
  \"operatorProfile\": {
    \"id\": \"op_123\",
    \"name\": \"Clifton Miller\",
    \"role\": \"primary_operator\",
    \"permissions\": [\"read\", \"wresonance\", \"veto\"]
  }
}
```

**Headers:**
```
Content-Type: application/json
```

### Refresh Token

**Endpoint:** `POST /auth/refresh`

**Request:**
```json
{
  \"refreshToken\": \"string\"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  \"accessToken\": \"string\",
  \"expiresIn\": 3600
}
```

### All Authenticated Requests

**Headers:**
```
Authorization: Bearer {accessToken}
Content-Type: application/json
```

